            "value": "Novità della 2.0"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Votre séance du jour": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your daily session"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu sesión diaria"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Tagestraining"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La tua sessione del giorno"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chaque jour, l'app prépare ce qu'il faut revoir : positions d'ouverture dues, puzzles ratés, une finale. Terminez-la pour allonger votre série de jours.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every day the app prepares what to review: opening positions due, missed puzzles, an endgame. Finish it to extend your streak of days."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada día, la app prepara lo que hay que repasar: posiciones de apertura pendientes, puzles fallados y un final. Termínala para alargar tu racha de días."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeden Tag stellt die App zusammen, was zu wiederholen ist: fällige Eröffnungsstellungen, verfehlte Puzzles, ein Endspiel. Schließe das Tagestraining ab, um deine Serie von Tagen zu verlängern."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ogni giorno l'app prepara ciò che c'è da ripassare: posizioni d'apertura in scadenza, puzzle sbagliati, un finale. Completala per allungare la tua serie di giorni."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Une pendule, si vous voulez": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A clock, if you like"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un reloj, si quieres"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Uhr, wenn du magst"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un orologio, se vuoi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "« Limite de temps » est éteinte par défaut : allumez-la pour choisir une cadence (Bullet, Blitz, Rapide…). L'app retient votre dernier choix.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Time limit” is off by default: switch it on to pick a time control (Bullet, Blitz, Rapid…). The app remembers your last choice."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "«Límite de tiempo» está desactivado por defecto: actívalo para elegir un ritmo (Bullet, Blitz, Rápida…). La app recuerda tu última elección."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„Zeitlimit“ ist standardmäßig aus: Schalte es ein, um eine Bedenkzeit zu wählen (Bullet, Blitz, Schnellschach…). Die App merkt sich deine letzte Wahl."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "«Limite di tempo» è spento per impostazione predefinita: accendilo per scegliere una cadenza (Bullet, Blitz, Rapid…). L'app ricorda la tua ultima scelta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L'app prépare chaque jour ce qu'il faut revoir — ouvertures, puzzles ratés, une finale — et compte votre série de jours, avec des médailles. Le plafond d'ouvertures se règle sur son écran.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every day the app prepares what to review — openings, missed puzzles, an endgame — and counts your streak of days, with medals. The opening cap is set on its screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Une cote de puzzle personnelle": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A personal puzzle rating"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una puntuación personal de puzles"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine persönliche Puzzle-Wertung"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un punteggio di puzzle personale"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vos puzzles vous donnent maintenant une cote, comme aux échecs, et la puce « À mon niveau » propose des puzzles à votre mesure. Prendre l'indice ne rapporte plus de points.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your puzzles now give you a rating, as in chess, and the “At my level” chip offers puzzles that fit you. Taking the hint no longer earns points."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analyse automatique et Coach": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic analysis and Coach"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Análisis automático y Coach"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatische Analyse und Coach"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Analisi automatica e Coach"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vos parties s'analysent d'elles-mêmes en tâche de fond (réglable), pour dessiner votre profil de faiblesses dans Progrès. Dans l'analyse, le Coach dit ce que jouent les joueurs de votre niveau. La dernière partie passe en tête de cet écran.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your games analyse themselves in the background (adjustable) to draw your weakness profile in Progress. In the analysis, the Coach tells you what players at your level play. The latest game now sits at the top of this screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Classiques, Camp, Niveau": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Classics, Side, Level"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clásicas, Bando, Nivel"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klassiker, Seite, Stufe"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Classiche, Lato, Livello"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deux menus filtrent les ouvertures : Camp (Blancs ou Noirs) et Niveau — dont « Classiques », les 19 ouvertures les plus jouées. Chaque carte montre la position clé et votre maîtrise.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two menus filter the openings: Side (White or Black) and Level — including “Classics”, the 19 most played openings. Each card shows the key position and your mastery."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La limite de temps, en option": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The time limit, optional"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El límite de tiempo, opcional"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
